Diagram Legend:
- Platform Layer: Entry points for developers and platform APIs
- Shared Services: Cross-cutting concerns applicable to both clouds
- Azure Cloud: Azure-specific integrations
- AWS Cloud: AWS-specific integrations
- Connectivity: Cross-cloud networking and data transfer
- Observability: Unified monitoring across clouds